sentences.text:
After considering all the facts and circumstances of the case, nature and gravity of offence, arguments advanced by the learned counsel for the applicant and also taking note of the fact that investigation is over and charge-sheet has been filed; allegation levelled against the present applicant for embezzlement of Rs.1,00,000/-,
which has been deposited by the present applicant; complainant has also admitted the same fact and has no objection if bail is given to the present applicant; applicant is not having any criminal past;
co-accused Hanslaal and Vineet have been enlarged on bail by this Court in similar circumstances and after rejecting the earlier bail application of applicant on merit, he has deposited the amount in question.

